      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "1. Beta 状态"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02a9df071fd6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.014",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 607,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 当前处于 Private Beta。功能、数据结构",
        "、界面和支持范围可能持续变化，部分能力可",
        "能不稳定或暂时不可用。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8b34a350fb12",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 716,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "2. 用户数据"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-2142c58a0083",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.016",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 779,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "用户对自己输入、编辑和导入的内容保留相应",
        "权利。PAIA 的产品目标是让这些内容保持可查",
        "看、可管理和可导出，而不是通过锁定用户数",
        "据建立使用门槛。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-545183381e6b",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 915,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "3. 备份责任"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-93497d3fbdd1",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 978,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "在 Beta 阶段，用户不应把 PAIA 作为自己重要",
        "数据的唯一副本。对于需要长期保存的内容，",
        "请同时保留独立备份。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4ec2d96ea607",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1087,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "4. 合理使用"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-766bfbf143b0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "请勿利用 PAIA 进行违法活动、未经授权的数据",
        "收集、侵犯他人隐私或知识产权，或规避第三",
        "方平台的访问和使用限制。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-e1ed409c1cf3",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1259,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "5. 第三方服务"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-abf5daffeea7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1322,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 可能与浏览器、AI 服务或其他第三方平台",
        "配合使用。第三方服务的可用性、条款和技术",
        "变化不由 PAIA 控制，相关功能可能因此调整。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-0dd451e52e3f",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.023",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1431,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 27,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "6. 可用性与责任边界"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-0fd69819906b",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "terms-zh-390.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1494,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Beta 版本按当前状态提供，不承诺持续、无错",
        "误或永久可用。产品会尽力降低数据风险，但",
        "用户仍应为重要资料保留独立备份。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-fdf713635ab1",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
